<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ESS Tech upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ESS Tech upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it raised the rating on ESS Technology Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst Charles Boucher said he expects a strong first quarter earnings report, likely to exceed his estimate of $0.42 per share.</p>
<p>-- also cited recent weakness in the stock, which he believes is a &quot;compelling investment opportunity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares rose 7/8 to 23-7/8.</p>
</text>
